@startuml dfd_context_level_0
title Context-Level Data Flow Diagram (DFD Level 0)

skinparam monochrome false

actor "Public Visitor" as Visitor
actor "Patient" as Patient
actor "Clinician" as Doctor
actor "Administrator" as Admin

rectangle "HeartXAI 2.0 System\n(Process 0.0)" as HeartXAI

database "PostgreSQL Relational DB" as DB
file "Model Artifact Store" as ModelStore

Visitor --> HeartXAI : 1. Sandbox Biomarkers & Public Requests
HeartXAI --> Visitor : 2. Educational Content & Stateless Sandbox Predictions

Patient --> HeartXAI : 3. Registration, Credentials & 13 Biomarkers
HeartXAI --> Patient : 4. Dual Risk Scores, SHAP Waterfall, Counterfactuals & Briefings

Doctor --> HeartXAI : 5. Credentials, Consultation Grant Queries & Review Notes
HeartXAI --> Doctor : 6. Authorized Patient Charts & Feature Attributions

Admin --> HeartXAI : 7. Verification Actions, Directory Edits & Audit Queries
HeartXAI --> Admin : 8. System Telemetry, Model Registries & Audit Logs

HeartXAI <--> DB : 9. Persistent CRUD Transactions & Immutable Audit Logs
HeartXAI <-- ModelStore : 10. Validated ML Pipeline (.joblib) with SHA-256 Checksum

@enduml
